# Bicycle care

## Tyre pressure

Check tyre pressure once a week. The recommended range is printed on the side of each tyre.

## Chain

Clean and lubricate the chain every few weeks, and after riding in rain. Wipe off any extra oil so it does not collect grit.

## Brakes

Replace brake pads when the wear grooves are no longer visible. Test both brakes before every ride.
EOF

